---
import logo from "../assets/energy-plus-logo.png";
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container site-footer__inner">
    <div class="site-footer__brand">
      <span class="footer-lockup">
        <img class="footer-lockup__logo" src={logo.src} width="104" height="30" alt="Energy Plus" />
        <span class="footer-lockup__div" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="wordmark__hotels">Hotels</span>
      </span>
      <p class="site-footer__line">
        Independent energy partner to hotels. We don't sell the box. We diagnose
        the property and verify the savings.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="site-footer__nav" aria-label="Footer">
      <a href="#problem">The problem</a>
      <a href="#procurement">The engineer</a>
      <a href="#what-we-find">What we find</a>
      <a href="#proof">Proof</a>
      <a href="#calculator">Calculator</a>
      <a href="#book">Book a 30-minute fit call</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <p class="site-footer__legal">
      <strong>How to read this page.</strong> Energy Plus is an independent
      energy solutions partner. We do not manufacture equipment. We diagnose
      each property and procure, size, and integrate the right technologies
      from our stack for that specific building. Case studies and figures
      reflect results achieved with specific technologies we deploy, under the
      conditions of those facilities. Your results will depend on your
      building, climate, occupancy, equipment condition, and utility rates,
      which is exactly why we measure your floor at your meter before you
      commit. Modeled numbers are directional estimates, not quotes.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="container site-footer__meta">
    <span>&copy; {year} Energy Plus</span>
    <span class="site-footer__neutral">Independent Energy Solutions Partner.</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg-header);
    padding-block: var(--space-xl) var(--space-l);
  }
  .site-footer__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-l);
  }
  .site-footer__brand {
    max-width: 34ch;
  }
  .footer-lockup {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .footer-lockup__logo {
    height: 26px;
    width: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .footer-lockup__div {
    width: 1px;
    height: 20px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
  }
  .wordmark__hotels {
    font-family: "Oswald", var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .site-footer__line {
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .site-footer__nav {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .site-footer__nav a {
    color: var(--body);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    transition: color 0.25s ease;
  }
  .site-footer__nav a:hover {
    color: var(--gold-text);
  }
  .site-footer__legal {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 78ch;
  }
  .site-footer__legal strong {
    color: var(--body);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .site-footer__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-m);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
